<title>HONG KONG: Shenzhen bourse set deadline for annual reports.</title>
<headline>Shenzhen bourse set deadline for annual reports.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Shenzhen Stock Exchange said on Monday it had set a deadline of April 30 for firms listed on the bourse to issue their audited annual reports for 1996.</p>
<p>The exchange said in a notice in the Shenzhen-based Securities Times that companies unable to release results by that date must submit applications to the exchange by April 15 for an extension.</p>
<p>Trading in shares of those companies would then be suspended from May 1 until they released the reports, it said.</p>
</text>
